{"id":"c050de49950a0f5f","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-stochastic-matrix.md","title":"Stochastic Matrix","display":"df-stochastic-matrix — Stochastic Matrix","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stochastic-matrix","aliases":["58-df-stochastic-matrix"],"display":"df-stochastic-matrix — Stochastic Matrix","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-transition-matrix.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stochastic-matrix"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stochastic-matrix</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stochastic-matrix — Stochastic Matrix"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a7eff3413ce92299\" href=\"?note=a7eff3413ce92299\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-transition-matrix.md\">../batch08/58-df-transition-matrix.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68f05138bfe79bb6\" href=\"?note=68f05138bfe79bb6\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md\">../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\emptyset\">\\(I\\ne\\emptyset\\)</span> is finite or countable and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=(p_{ij})_{i,j\\in I}:I\\times I\\to\\mathbb R\">\\(P=(p_{ij})_{i,j\\in I}:I\\times I\\to\\mathbb R\\)</span> (matrix)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (set-coded function predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StochasticMatrix}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StochasticMatrix}_S\\)</span> (stochastic-matrix predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{StochasticMatrix}_S(P,I)\\leftrightarrow I\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\bigl(|I|&lt;\\aleph_0\\lor|I|=\\aleph_0\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,I\\times I,[0,1])\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\sum_{j\\in I}P(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stochastic\\text{-}matrix} \\vdash \\mathrm{StochasticMatrix}_S(P,I)\\leftrightarrow I\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\bigl(|I|&lt;\\aleph_0\\lor|I|=\\aleph_0\\bigr)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(P,I\\times I,[0,1])\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\left(\\sum_{j\\in I}P(\\langle i,j\\rangle)=1\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Row-stochastic matrices encode transition probabilities; entries are obtained from a set-coded function on ordered index pairs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-transition-matrix.md","status":"resolved","id":"a7eff3413ce92299","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-transition-matrix.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md","status":"resolved","id":"68f05138bfe79bb6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-matrix-method.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetA